	(text "Power in: 12 V bench supply on TP5 (+, red) / TP6 (GND, black) via alligator clips.\nD201 blocks reverse polarity (~0.35 V drop). FB201 + C201-C203 filter -> DC_Bias (~11.6 V).\nV101 (SIM ONLY) still drives DC_Bias in simulation."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.748 169.672 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "34ea57eb-375a-464b-99f1-80b459d3edc7")
	)
	(text "RF buffer Q102: common-emitter stage. R112 (51R) sets Zout ~50 ohm,\nindependent of how lightly C109 couples to the tank.\nC109 = 1p: light tank loading (~90k), roughly -10 dBm out.\nC109 = 2.2p: ~-4 dBm out but ~4x heavier tank loading.\nBias ~10 mA; R113/C111 decouple the buffer supply.\nR114 is a SIM-ONLY 50R load for J1 (excluded from board/BOM)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 24.13 148.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37417603-ae47-4dca-afb1-d03130ee55b9")
	)
	(text "Trimmer \nCapacitor\n= C5\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.196 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5dc1ae99-7987-4c02-88e3-0cf1dad95f7f")
	)
	(text "Audio: U2 differential MEMS mic -> U1A diff amp (x19.6) -> U1B (x1..16, RV201) -> AUDIO_OUT -> R208 -> varactor D101.\nVMID = VCC_AUDIO/2 sets the op-amp DC level and the varactor reverse bias.\nV102 is SIM ONLY (U1/U2 have no SPICE model): ampl=0 for a clean carrier; e.g. ampl=1.27 f=200k to see FM sidebands."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 274.32 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "64c19c85-11c6-4b5b-a926-d68c3a1b2f54")
	)
	(text "Supplies: VCC_AUDIO = DC_Bias via R201/C204 (~11.0 V). VMID = VCC_AUDIO/2 (R202/R203, C206).\nU3 makes 3V3 for the mic. U1 power unit decoupled by C212."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 280.924 238.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "67f73d24-2ab3-45b0-8dfa-634476f40dd2")
	)
	(text "Varactor FM: D101 (1SV229) reverse-biased by AUDIO_OUT (DC = VMID ~5.5 V) through R208.\nC106 (10p) couples it to the tank. Est. ~59 kHz/V -> +/-75 kHz needs ~1.27 V peak.\nSet deviation with RV201. See README for the calculation."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 155.194 74.422 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "79862cc4-7498-468e-8c3e-9572f6e7f2cc")
	)
	(text "PWR LED: D202 green on DC_Bias (~1.9 mA).\nAfter D201, so it lights only with correct polarity."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 220.218 269.748 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7f6e2ed8-3772-4d00-b74a-00756f05b02e")
	)
	(text "TX ENABLE (Rev B): S101 slide switch drives TX_EN.\nTX: TX_EN = 3V3 -> U101 RFC-RF1 -> J1 antenna, red D102 on.\nSTBY: TX_EN = 0 V -> RFC-RF2 -> J2 TEST (analyzer / 50 ohm terminator).\nR116 holds STBY if S101 is mid-travel. Oscillator + buffer run in both states (no carrier pulling)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 18.288 246.634 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bdecb72e-635a-43a0-8ca7-5e828a20a725")
	)
	(text ".tran 20p 20u 0 20p"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 89.916 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d4f299f1-cdc8-4711-92b9-d0836e1d997f")
	)
	(text "Closed-loop Colpitts: Tank_Output feeds back through C102 to the base.\nV101 ramps the supply 0->12 V in 20 ns to kick-start oscillation.\nRun a TRAN analysis; plot V(/Tank_Output)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dd489f36-3033-4da5-9442-fc90a125760b")
	)
